### Login

POST {{host}}/v1/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameid": "admin",
  "password": "Senha123@"
}

###

### Refresh

POST {{host}}/v1/identity/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Logout

POST {{host}}/v1/identity/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### Change password

PUT {{host}}/v1/identity/password
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nameid": "igor6",
  "currentPassword": "Password123!",
  "newPassword": "Password456!"
}
